printings: ['10E', '2ED', '2X2', '2XM', '30A', '3ED', '40K', '4BB', '4ED', '5DN', '5ED', '6ED', '7ED', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'AFC', 'AFR', 'AKH', 'AKR', 'ALA', 'ANA', 'ANB', 'ARC', 'ARN', 'ATH', 'AVR', 'BBD', 'BFZ', 'BLB', 'BRB', 'BRC', 'BRO', 'BTD', 'C13', 'C14', 'C15', 'C16', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'C20', 'C21', 'CED', 'CEI', 'CHK', 'CLB', 'CLU', 'CM2', 'CMA', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CN2', 'CNS', 'CSP', 'CST', 'DD1', 'DD2', 'DDE', 'DDF', 'DDG', 'DDH', 'DDI', 'DDJ', 'DDK', 'DDL', 'DDM', 'DDN', 'DDO', 'DDP', 'DDQ', 'DDS', 'DDT', 'DDU', 'DIS', 'DKM', 'DMR', 'DMU', 'DOM', 'DPA', 'DST', 'DTK', 'E01', 'ELD', 'EMA', 'EVG', 'F01', 'F02', 'F03', 'F04', 'F05', 'F07', 'F09', 'FBB', 'FRF', 'FUT', 'G00', 'G17', 'GK1', 'GK2', 'GN2', 'GN3', 'GNT', 'GRN', 'GS1', 'H09', 'HA1', 'HBG', 'HOP', 'HOU', 'ICE', 'IKO', 'IMA', 'INV', 'ISD', 'ITP', 'J14', 'J21', 'J22', 'JMP', 'JVC', 'KHC', 'KHM', 'KLD', 'KLR', 'KTK', 'LCC', 'LCI', 'LEA', 'LEB', 'LGN', 'LRW', 'LTC', 'LTR', 'M10', 'M11', 'M12', 'M13', 'M14', 'M15', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'MBS', 'ME1', 'ME2', 'ME3', 'ME4', 'MH1', 'MH2', 'MH3', 'MID', 'MIR', 'MKC', 'MKM', 'MM2', 'MM3', 'MMA', 'MMQ', 'MOC', 'MOM', 'MP2', 'MRD', 'NCC', 'NEM', 'NEO', 'NPH', 'ODY', 'OLEP', 'ONC', 'ONE', 'ONS', 'ORI', 'OTJ', 'OTP', 'P02', 'P05', 'P08', 'P09', 'P23', 'PAL00', 'PAL01', 'PAL02', 'PAL03', 'PAL04', 'PAL05', 'PAL06', 'PAL99', 'PALP', 'PANA', 'PARL', 'PBOOK', 'PC2', 'PCA', 'PD2', 'PDCI', 'PELP', 'PEWK', 'PF19', 'PF20', 'PF24', 'PGPX', 'PGRU', 'PIP', 'PJJT', 'PJSE', 'PL24', 'PLGM', 'PLS', 'PLST', 'PMEI', 'PMPS', 'PMPS06', 'PMPS07', 'PMPS08', 'PMPS09', 'PMPS10', 'PMPS11', 'POR', 'PPP1', 'PRM', 'PRW2', 'PRWK', 'PS11', 'PSAL', 'PSS2', 'PSS3', 'PSS4', 'PSUS', 'PTC', 'PTK', 'PW21', 'PZ1', 'PZ2', 'RAV', 'REX', 'RIX', 'RNA', 'ROE', 'RQS', 'RTR', 'RVR', 'S99', 'SCD', 'SCG', 'SHM', 'SIR', 'SLD', 'SNC', 'SOI', 'SOM', 'SS1', 'STA', 'STX', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'THS', 'TMP', 'TPR', 'TSB', 'TSP', 'TSR', 'UGL', 'UMA', 'UND', 'UNF', 'UNH', 'USG', 'UST', 'V13', 'VIS', 'VMA', 'VOW', 'W16', 'W17', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOC', 'WOE', 'WTH', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ["({2\\nR} can be paid with any two mana or with {R}. This card's converted mana cost is 6.)\\nFlame Javelin deals 4 damage to target creature or player.", '+1: Chandra Nalaar deals 1 damage to target player.\\n–\\nX: Chandra Nalaar deals X damage to target creature.\\n–8: Chandra Nalaar deals 10 damage to target player and each creature he or she controls.', '+2: Each player draws a card.\\n–1: Target player draws a card.\\n–10: Target player puts the top twenty cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.', 'Affinity for Islands (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each Island you control.)\\nFlying', 'Affinity for Mountains (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each Mountain you control.)\\nHaste', 'Cone of Flame deals 1 damage to target creature or player, 2 damage to another target creature or player, and 3 damage to a third target creature or player.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {X}. Scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'Counter target spell.', 'Defender\\n{3}: Turn Wall of Deceit face down.\\nMorph {U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', "Demonfire deals X damage to target creature or player. If a creature dealt damage this way would die this turn, exile it instead.\\nHellbent — If you have no cards in hand, Demonfire can't be countered by spells or abilities and the damage can't be prevented.", 'Fireball deals X damage divided evenly, rounded down, among any number of target creatures and/or players.\\nFireball costs {1} more to cast for each target beyond the first.', 'Firebolt deals 2 damage to target creature or player.\\nFlashback {4}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Flying', "Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Waterspout Djinn unless you return an untapped Island you control to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\\nSuspend 4—{1}{U} (Rather than cast this card from your hand, you may pay {1}{U} and exile it with four time counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter. When the last is removed, cast it without paying its mana cost. It has haste.)', "Flying\\nWhen Mulldrifter enters the battlefield, draw two cards.\\nEvoke {2}{U} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", "Flying\\nWhen Riftwing Cloudskate enters the battlefield, return target permanent to its owner's hand.\\nSuspend 3—{1}{U} (Rather than cast this card from your hand, you may pay {1}{U} and exile it with three time counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter. When the last is removed, cast it without paying its mana cost. It has haste.)", 'Flying\\n{R}: Furnace Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{T}: Fledgling Mawcor deals 1 damage to target creature or player.\\nMorph {U}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', "Flying\\n{U}: If target spell has only one target and that target is Quicksilver Dragon, change that spell's target to another creature.\\nMorph {4}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)", "Guile can't be blocked except by three or more creatures.\\nIf a spell or ability you control would counter a spell, instead exile that spell and you may play that card without paying its mana cost.\\nWhen Guile is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library.", "Haste\\nIf a spell you control would deal damage to an opponent, prevent that damage. Put a 3/1 red Elemental Shaman creature token with haste onto the battlefield for each 1 damage prevented this way.\\nWhen Hostility is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library.", 'Haste\\nWhenever Slith Firewalker deals combat damage to a player, put a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Haste\\n{R}: Pyre Charger gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Incinerate deals 3 damage to target creature or player. A creature dealt damage this way can't be regenerated this turn.", 'Keldon Megaliths enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} to your mana pool.\\nHellbent — {1}{R}, {T}: Keldon Megaliths deals 1 damage to target creature or player. Activate this ability only if you have no cards in hand.', 'Magma Jet deals 2 damage to target creature or player. Scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'Morph {1}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Willbender is turned face up, change the target of target spell or ability with a single target.', 'Morph {2}{U}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Voidmage Apprentice is turned face up, counter target spell.', 'Morph {5}{U}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Brine Elemental is turned face up, each opponent skips his or her next untap step.', "Morph—\\nReturn two Islands you control to their owner's hand. (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Fathom Seer is turned face up, draw two cards.", 'R', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.\\nDraw a card.", 'Reveal the top five cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Sacrifice Bottle Gnomes: You gain 3 life.', 'Sacrifice Seal of Fire: Seal of Fire deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'Suspend 4—{U} (Rather than cast this card from your hand, pay {U} and exile it with four time counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter. When the last is removed, cast it without paying its mana cost.)\\nTarget player draws three cards.', 'U', 'When Flametongue Kavu enters the battlefield, it deals 4 damage to target creature.', "When Ingot Chewer enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact.\\nEvoke {R} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", "When Inner-Flame Acolyte enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+0 and gains haste until end of turn.\\nEvoke {R} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", "When Man-o'-War enters the battlefield, return target creature to its owner's hand.", "When Æthersnipe enters the battlefield, return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand.\\nEvoke {1}{U}{U} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", "Whenever Ophidian attacks and isn't blocked, you may draw a card. If you do, Ophidian assigns no combat damage this turn.", "You may return an Island you control to its owner's hand rather than pay Daze's mana cost.\\nCounter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.", "You may return two Islands you control to their owner's hand rather than pay Gush's mana cost.\\nDraw two cards.", "You may sacrifice two Mountains rather than pay Fireblast's mana cost.\\nFireblast deals 4 damage to target creature or player.", '{2}, Reveal X blue cards from your hand, Sacrifice Martyr of Frost: Counter target spell unless its controller pays {X}.', '{2}: Target creature gains trample until end of turn. If this is the third time this ability has resolved this turn, you may add {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R} to your mana pool.', '{7}{R}: Flamewave Invoker deals 5 damage to target player.', '{R}: Chartooth Cougar gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nMountaincycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Mountain card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', '{R}: Flamekin Brawler gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{R}{R}: Rakdos Pit Dragon gains flying until end of turn.\\n{R}: Rakdos Pit Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nHellbent — Rakdos Pit Dragon has double strike as long as you have no cards in hand.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Mind Stone: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{2}, {T}: You may put a basic land card from your hand onto the battlefield tapped.', '{T}: Fireslinger deals 1 damage to target creature or player and 1 damage to you.']
